&gt;Tool: Select Styling Specimens&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Lean Rada Describes Inline Rendering Trick Using document.currentScript</title><link>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/lean-rada-describes-inline-rendering-trick-using-document-currentscript/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 22:01:16 +0530</pubDate><guid>https://shoubhikbanerjee.github.io/blog/p/lean-rada-describes-inline-rendering-trick-using-document-currentscript/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="lean-rada-describes-inline-rendering-trick-using-documentcurrentscript"&gt;Lean Rada Describes Inline Rendering Trick Using document.currentScript
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;On 17th October 2026, Lean Rada described a trick for inline rendering that utilizes the &lt;code&gt;document.currentScript&lt;/code&gt; property. This method allows a tiny inline &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; element to replace itself with dynamic content when a page loads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-how-it-works"&gt;🧩 How it works
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The trick functions by having a script reference its own position in the document to swap itself for new data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic Implementation: An inline script can use &lt;code&gt;document.currentScript.replaceWith(new Date().getFullYear())&lt;/code&gt; to replace the tag with the current year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shortcut Function: A shortcut can be defined as &lt;code&gt;$=(...n)=&amp;gt;document.currentScript.replaceWith(...n)&lt;/code&gt; to simplify the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Template Language: This shortcut creates a tiny template language, allowing for inline syntax such as &lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;script&amp;gt;$(new Date().getFullYear())&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="-key-details"&gt;⚙️ Key details
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Item&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: left"&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Core Property&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;document.currentScript&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Replacement Method&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;.replaceWith()&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Shortcut Definition&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;$=(&amp;hellip;n)=&amp;gt;document.currentScript.replaceWith(&amp;hellip;n)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Creator&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: left"&gt;Lean Rada&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
